  "structure": {
    "block_count": 34,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "In a Baby-Making Rut? Here's How to Keep the Romance Alive",
        "text_sha256": "a00d1c2173fa951027bb50ef648e9538ff1fd96aeaca6a64103bca3299da40d6",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Preconception Relationships",
        "text_sha256": "032ff7aeae5e54647bb7952b78b008e3a938bd06c3e5fe1ba8a37c64785329f3",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You would think sex and conception go hand in hand, but lovemaking can begin to feel like a chore when getting pregnant becomes your priority. Here are seven ways to restore the heat.",
        "text_sha256": "27a6872e69c2fe49f4cf3cc84980eb5f31c09ad8d8036755734759e082cc68ca",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ovulation calendars. Sperm counts. Urinating on a test strip. Aren't you having fun baby-making? Not! Trying for a baby can be very trying if you're, well, trying.",
        "text_sha256": "4560f8d67c503ffa04d99d7e41d181b9b1b398e3a64eac09247a28ac6fd779b4",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Although you and your partner may be physically closer than ever, your emotional connection may take a hit with all that pressure on both of you to perform. Chances are, you'll hit that sex-on-demand rut that many hopeful parents-to-be find themselves in when sex becomes a means towards an end (in this case, a baby) rather than a means towards a \"happy ending.\"",
        "text_sha256": "9a41e4ad814cfebe55191778bf22a7f0911fc70d3d0fce46c7dce508c22a1a89",
        "word_count": 63
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But baby-making doesn't have to feel like a chore, even with ovulation charts and pregnancy kits lining the bathroom counter. Here's how to nurture your twosome as you work to make your family a threesome.",
        "text_sha256": "d61a93c609cdcd9539a51be44342a3fa02dbf427de4e93287c5798a0d0a13e7e",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Vary the venue. A night in a motel, a few scented candles, or even doing it in a different room might help you both rediscover that ol’ spark.",
        "text_sha256": "5d6780b7d3ca5f1d9188463a7f58941972e41053c7661dab8d2c862e87c3d6a4",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Make it fun! It might not be your usual approach, but consider a few suggestive texts, a revealing outfit, or a sexy movie to get the baby-making rolling.",
        "text_sha256": "ff7500ae8e34be187c553789693d71458cc5d6b6ea42f32238ef90537a29092e",
        "word_count": 28
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Talk it over. Connecting while you cuddle and being open about your feelings can matter just as much as the timing of your trysts.",
        "text_sha256": "fe91ada54bf4286fd91ed5f6d7efd7b68f44468bad321fe04168be9d3a9e0a85",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Take a mini vacation",
        "text_sha256": "8b99863c143d1d60704708d344321052ee6322e6c6f8faa28d8e9e5218fe93df",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "When you're trying to get pregnant, sex can start to feel routine. Spice it up by switching up the location. If you're able, sneak off to a hotel for the night. Add in a spa treatment (or give each other a massage at home) to de-stress and get in the mood.",
        "text_sha256": "39e6b574c995fccd840db20448dd33c0d46dc81888f3096c2602b06140603dcb",
        "word_count": 51
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you can't get away, change the scenery by taking your lovemaking out of the bedroom — something that'll be much harder once you have a little one around! Try the living room or the kitchen.",
        "text_sha256": "2daabd3103cbb45611a18143b537c6cb0d0baba39916cd31e1e546ad4b44a848",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Watch a sexy movie",
        "text_sha256": "c16aa5a79fa0a55873adf4ed9e6964e335f9c8573bde2c2aa148c80992a0f94b",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "It won't just get you both in the mood — it may actually help you conceive faster! In one study, when researchers had men watch a scene with sexual content right before doing the deed, they found that the sperm they produced was of higher quality. Trusted SourceEvolutionary Psychological ScienceMen Ejaculate Larger Volumes of Semen, More Motile Sperm, and More Quickly When Exposed to Images of Novel WomenSee All Sources [1] (Yes, really!)",
        "text_sha256": "16441690d85ed72d76093cf0975b3270b82e6a0b5964c1be906633cd6406c880",
        "word_count": 73
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceEvolutionary Psychological ScienceMen Ejaculate Larger Volumes of Semen, More Motile Sperm, and More Quickly When Exposed to Images of Novel WomenSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "f5ddfec68501ffce998ee0dbe58fadb1395e499dc3db88763f763c8e3d43c240",
        "word_count": 24
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Other research has found that it can increase levels of progesterone, a sex hormone thought to increase romantic behavior. Trusted SourceNational Institutes of Health, National Library of Medicine, Hormones and BehaviorEffects of Affiliation and Power Motivation Arousal on Salivary Progesterone and TestosteroneSee All Sources [2]",
        "text_sha256": "6828a636b3c095290ae9a58d96028ef364ffe02318ac0620081ff21b1e6c9f54",
        "word_count": 45
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceNational Institutes of Health, National Library of Medicine, Hormones and BehaviorEffects of Affiliation and Power Motivation Arousal on Salivary Progesterone and TestosteroneSee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "8f04d2558a6bb584130253876c5a5ee5daf5d4f46bb9d170f3d35590b81a42e2",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Want more romantic tips while TTC? Download the What to Expect app for support and smart ideas from a community of parents who get where you are right now.",
        "text_sha256": "82822c2a3899afb7cc156fb670e795d8824ef511c30329094fe564c1055cefba",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Set the scene",
        "text_sha256": "f774139f7e46d515255bf856c5e8255dfe5cefe218f07dd96be8c1c709ba0df6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Get yourself a sexy nightie, light some candles, crank up some get-in-the-mood music, and let the hanky-panky begin! Or make things a little more playful with a game like strip poker or nude Twister or your favorite R-rated board game. When the lovemaking is over, spend some time cuddling. (It might increase your odds of getting pregnant — it gives the sperm time to get through your cervix!)",
        "text_sha256": "20fd53d7a0fa55b9ab07760608c65efb3323206dbe192746ebd576c700c1c80f",
        "word_count": 68
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Spice it up",
        "text_sha256": "37f83ec232156c151dad5f000f1050ad38eca98f29619332ed41ecb94067b6ad",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Surprise him (and maybe yourself) by doing something out of the ordinary: Invest in some sex toys , crank up the passion with something sweet (chocolate syrup, anyone?), or try a new position . Although you may have heard fertility myths that the missionary position or penetration from behind are best for babymaking, any sex position will do for conception — so try them all!",
        "text_sha256": "e6de2290075a8ba820411c0386492428d6e939908552c60f5982ec852fe21a2c",
        "word_count": 65
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Steer clear of lubricants and oral sex when trying to get pregnant, though — saliva and lubricants can damage sperm.",
        "text_sha256": "36f221351e002ca5e12c1139b59ef628202a35b9b64f93a5a27f8bcf162d2ed6",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Laugh a little",
        "text_sha256": "6d4cf7d035f6d148a3350db88db91434a4be8500de7f3a66b44b762e39ce07a2",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "There's no question that babymaking is serious business. But if you loosen up a little, it's not only good for your relationship — it's one of the best ways to relax, too.",
        "text_sha256": "ef1065e697c9dcea4b460821d21924caa412a34bfe2c2c5dd854e017a7643f27",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Stream that silly comedy you were embarrassed about actually going to see in a movie theater, or catch up on old episodes of Saturday Night Live . Look for the humor in trying to conceive wherever you can, including frantic temperature checks and dashes to the bedroom. Remember, laughter's the best medicine, and it can help you get through those first months or years after your baby finally arrives, too.",
        "text_sha256": "78fd60d5d0a86e6a54b39d57991be3544c380aac227483f0b012bad5d3c496c3",
        "word_count": 70
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Sex up your phones",
        "text_sha256": "bc0f1a5d80ad27aceefafedb9759755268c8f84b9968fed47a0befbfc798c2ec",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Spice up your normal texts with some suggestive messages or alluring pictures to whet his appetite for what's on the menu tonight (hint: you). Spell out exactly what you will — and will not — be wearing, and what you want to happen. You'll keep him in anticipation and on edge for the rest of the day.",
        "text_sha256": "d5596e019b40efa2e13d6970f2a3065f801df4d1245150d14ff26f8036fd967c",
        "word_count": 57
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What to Expect Community parent BAVN15 used her phone to her advantage. “I would send my husband a sexy text while at work and flirt a little and then just let the moment find us without tracking it,” she shares.",
        "text_sha256": "16fa5158557401ad4d2ea3400f50b783de07f438a45f4129f3c0c56d96e5653b",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Up the romance",
        "text_sha256": "464ff0510f6af6b0a1fb24985bd87498bdfdafeb710b4e7e4cedd0811da344e6",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Think moonlit strolls holding hands, dinner by candlelight, cuddling in front of the fireplace. Focus on the romance and see what happens next.",
        "text_sha256": "f3660644fbbfe05068edf97126a59266c316ae5ebdda9cccdac121f227a3ab6c",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But whatever you do, make sure you keep talking. The physical is only part of it. Stay connected emotionally by sharing your feelings about sex, conception, and your future life as parents. This will take both your romance and your relationship a long way.",
        "text_sha256": "2fadd497adf2eae060f6e99b13d01edfb3e4a8cfc8e70040dc1bf83a92a10a70",
        "word_count": 44
      }
    ],
    "content_word_count": 985,
    "heading_count": 9
  },
